                <img alt="Induced logo" width="16" height="16" class="mr-1 rounded" src="/logos/extra-logo.png" />Extraordinary
              </a>, a core element to early startups.
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2.5">
              enjoys{" "}
              <HoverInfo
                label="travelling"
                ariaLabel="View travel destinations"
                heading="Travel Destinations"
                description="Passionate about travel and cultural experiences. Places visited and dream destinations include: Vietnam, Thailand, Indonesia, United States, Japan, China, United Kingdom, France"
