              />, robotics, fast cars and also learning 日本語.
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2.5">
              i also{" "}
              <HoverInfo
                label="mentor"
                ariaLabel="View mentorships"
                heading="Mentorships"
                description="Providing mentorship and guidance at educational institutions including: LPU, Rungta, ITM"
